      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-Spec driven development (SDD) is a software development approach where a detailed specification\ndocument is written before any code is written\n- The spec acts as the single source of truth for what the system should do, and all development flows from it.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-Spec driven development (SDD) is a software development approach where a detailed specification\ndocument is written before any code is written\n- The spec acts as the single source of truth for what the system should do, and all development flows from it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
