      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791605715398,
      "created": 1791589033503,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- A written specification\n- You define them upfront\n- High - you lead\n- Slow upfront, faster overall\n- Consistent and traceable\n- Production systems, teams, complex apps\n- Over-specified, rigid if requirements change\n- Check against spec to find drift\n- Yes - you own the spec",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- A written specification\n- You define them upfront\n- High - you lead\n- Slow upfront, faster overall\n- Consistent and traceable\n- Production systems, teams, complex apps\n- Over-specified, rigid if requirements change\n- Check against spec to find drift\n- Yes - you own the spec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
